<title>课间说川话成违纪，学生：难道犯了天条？中媒：禁令本身就错据港媒报道，四川宜宾一学生投诉，课间说四川话被老师拍照取证、定性</title>
<link>https://t.me/OutsightChina/10575</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/OutsightChina/10575</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 04:29:04 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>课间说川话成违纪，学生：难道犯了天条？中媒：禁令本身就错</b><br/><br/>据港媒报道，四川宜宾一学生投诉，课间说四川话被老师拍照取证、定性违纪，须写500字检讨。学生质疑：“四川人说四川话，难道犯了天条？”<br/><br/>当地教体局20日答复称，法规未禁止课间说方言，责令废止相关规定。25日再称校方执行“机械化、简单化”，对涉事教师通报批评、诫勉谈话。<br/><br/>据自由亚洲电台报道，2021年宜宾亦有一年级女孩因说不好普通话崩溃大哭，视频引发争议；同年四川要求公务场合须用普通话。<br/><br/>光明网评论员引亲历者称，90年代中后期已有中小学“推普员”执行“课间不说普通话就扣分”；教育部2020年已称推普与传承方言“并不矛盾”，但学校却仍以拍照、写检查执行禁令，并质疑校规“存量清理”能否靠逐条上热搜推动。<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A">#社会</a> <a href="?q=%23%E6%95%99%E8%82%B2">#教育</a> <a href="?q=%23%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80">#语言</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%9B%9B%E5%B7%9D">#四川</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/>《香港01》<a href="https://global.hk01.com/article/60415123" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">四川学生小息讲四川话被当违纪 怒轰如犯天条 教育局责令废止</a><br/>《澎湃新闻》<a href="https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_34559696" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">学生课间说四川话被认定违纪，官方回应</a><br/>《自由亚洲电台》<a href="https://www.rfa.org/mandarin/yataibaodao/kejiaowen/sc-10292021141341.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">四川女孩因说不好普通话崩溃大哭 相关视频引发争议</a>（2021-10-29）<br/>《光明网》<a href="https://guancha.gmw.cn/2026-11/26/content_39124168.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">光明网评论员：“课间禁方言”，过时校规该退出</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/vEI5sZdc2fDRPeo_BmxaFxynG7pin-K8IQLlCHBmoxWUZsw3zcMdjT3-g5Er9mB0_El6bR3c3-dgqQ3IO4hksmdDKHasKBwCj6hY3BLWFkd735SNpgLsElqdiKgLek0cl7lvVIHAo1E3bWbK0UPl1WcYep-VAG88XQyFbjH7tjWCVFMUPmDTYzLSo3dXfiFCQIF_3t6ETvoEzzmsQvWQ3LDgZQn_wjsVj1tPAn4E28YRbEJx8zxju2aY9r7G9CGG4g3AY83O3v82KJZyiw_MQb53KXLMfUzMsw2HjHkDgW9sHFlZYcH4FvUTMSLRwSAb8daiK-F9CEiiv93LcMH0sQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/hODd_JqYr4i5-FJAVhN4vgtPlp27OD4XWlpiba_kNL2jHvhWPLfcLDbctXkFzTsNYAu347eR1hIgkXXTfmlPKxxMT48O05jNbHUPlkEvXMkpaf7cKApFGUxy5_J-Q71S3KqaT0CFyhIUPg-vdA8Ib3HW4lutecsZcZR37u9_TNQUmfjqe68xNgv6-WYWresS9nuAkVTMaAqQLNAuGafvyo-Sv0PR02NK9yDtXfhktAhwjDw81YdCWuSiLM00ytRTsz9ENK3QH8QFvXgngfrQaPf3-h-H-AxbUbo4WErUBcrT887yteaTcx3_iNnVHRsw0iUV0SN6gxdohy7K9uJDBw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/DRq-F5z562-xJ75n6ZiGvPiv3fm5rfaNxG2O873wjLmzqWplWRuIdOSGiAjwzCs6nHI0DSGNE50NPqoqyqO4i3D43NhiVaBywhAHf7w__-tvyI10usg1o_Z_p3nFlKuKdC7lCEzdqQvYzCJn9-BoI8a9n6f_UxbDlkX3loqjG-Z1hCyYArB42gjaeBNaDMVCOiG1Doy7Cr-bTBBwACyfN_8VcF3V-__qcI8l4UARVT1wj3Ur8If2UsiC83mPkGcrssESJ2oGPoPdYnusY2TcPyKPCcfKZmTKsW4bxS_v_rvA_xCJq4U_JfMrXQOKfPtCqsCDMxz6Phn37PI4RvFStA.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/vESwheAtnqVqn9LUrXeIMWtjgojWtmtmFFLld_Aw7wkTNN4Zsz8h08PK7pYnbfaLN3JwUwIv5I-GrVfr37spFw2k2qvcZJgcQLpNjv-C5ZF5pXWx3x_eYmat-mGUs8f4zRMOB5PNBUbj-9-sifI2SpLkKM5NTT8RN7ZHfnmfv2aK4t6OLsSfqvS_EplTmg2Oc5x0xUhSTzRH5cisBi6H5x6XU3m0kuUEUavAyDOk8nYk1zadGUCd00tVd4mPK_n_tGBeAlAoFmLxpVkW0MVfirc3eHs4dJR5jpCa6QQovB9F2MbsTM5MVKDCaiHrANzMu-TJp8s9fAwNEqBieMeF7w.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9881.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4AE.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E29DA4.png" referrerpol